      "html": "<p>This beautiful Pyrrhulina can be recognized best by the broad dark lateral band. The maximum size reported for P. filamentosa is 10 cm. It is a beautiful, representative aquarium fish.</p><p>Suggestion of a common name: Broadband-Pyrrhulina.</p>"
